"""
pgswin.py — PG-Swin: Prototype-Guided Shifted-Window Transformer for
Interpretable Hippocampal Segmentation (MSD Task04).

Minimal single-file consolidation of the exact dependencies of
pgswin_colab.ipynb. Contains only:
    * the base blocks and ResUNet3D trunk (from models_phase1.py),
    * the 3D window attention base class (from models_phase1_swin.py),
    * the PG-Swin model and its components (from models_pgswin.py),
    * the BCEDiceLoss used for training (from shared_losses.py),
    * the data loading, metrics and statistics used by the notebook
      (from multiseed_pipeline.py),
    * the fingerprint and CSV-validation helpers (from repro_utils.py),
    * the PG-Swin training loop and multi-seed driver (from the notebook).

Usage:
    python pgswin.py
"""

